Scope
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

This MIT License applies to the FLOW ISA Plugin SDK:

  include/flow/isa/      — SDK-stable plugin interface headers
  sdk/cmake/             — FlowPlugin.cmake build helpers
  sdk/docs/              — Plugin authoring documentation
  sdk/templates/         — Starter plugin templates
  sdk/examples/          — Worked example ISA plugins

Plugins you build against this SDK are your own independent work and carry
no license obligations beyond this MIT notice.

